        "prompt": {
          "es": "Cuenta tu lunes caótico con cuatro modismos y explica dos (70-150 palabras)."
        },
        "answer": {
          "text": "Let me tell you an anecdote about my chaotic Monday. First, I was under the weather, which means I felt a bit ill, but I went to work anyway. Then my bus broke down, and my phone died: that was the last straw, in other words, I could not take any more. I ran to the office and arrived in the nick of time, and my boss did not hit the roof. Luckily, the meeting was cancelled, so my bad day was a blessing in disguise. By and large, it was a difficult day, but it is a funny anecdote now.",
